::instructions

# Day before
(sourdough starter) <feed, for next day, feeding amounts not supplied>
(grain) + (water, preparation) 500g <boil, 45m>
(linseed) + (sesame) + (sunflower seeds) + (water, preparation) remaining 100g <place, bowl>
(grain) + {seed mixture} <store, locked bowl, overnight, 13-16h>
# Bread
{seeds and grains} <drain, leftover water>
    + (sourdough) + (water, 25-35°C) + (rye flour) + (wheat flour) + (sea salt) + (bread spice) <stir> <knead, well>
    <rest, warm, 25-30°C, 5h>
(oven) <preheat, 250°C>
{dough} <bake, with steam, up to 20m>
(oven) <release, steam> <reduce heat, 150°C>
{bread} <bake, 50-60m more>

